<h2>Bottom Line</h2>

<p>The ATOM SE is dated, but at a sale price it's still one of the cheapest ways to get a GPS drone that shoots 4K. Treat it as a learning drone rather than a filmmaking tool, and spend a little more if smooth video is why you're buying.</p>

